{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04040","headline":"奉和魏仆射秋日还乡有怀之作 · 苏頲","name":"奉和魏仆射秋日还乡有怀之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫夙拜罢，东道昼游初。\n饮饯倾冠盖，传呼问里闾。\n树悲悬劒所，溪想钓璜余。\n明发辉光至，增荣驷马车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}